  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_7247.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado se ha celebrado en los Salones Campus las gala de fin de curso de las diferentes escuelas de baile de Onda, con danza del vientre, sevillanas, o los tangos, cha cha cha y salsa de la Asociaci&oacute;n Amics del Ball. El numeroso p&uacute;blico asistente ha aplaudido a rabiar todas las actuaciones.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7220.jpg\" alt=\"img_7220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7221.jpg\" alt=\"img_7221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7223.jpg\" alt=\"img_7223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7224.jpg\" alt=\"img_7224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7225.jpg\" alt=\"img_7225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7226.jpg\" alt=\"img_7226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7228.jpg\" alt=\"img_7228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7229.jpg\" alt=\"img_7229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendaescolesballonda13/img_7230.jpg\" alt=\"img_7230\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh